rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sXXohRlBA3wQ7kNvwGU5SG1&_nc_oc=Adq1LDVXu3ynL95P-jCeM_-dXGKjFc6aQFfGnJXEhFuYONB9WblgAgyytxmjxuELbiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQJSjiaxN7C1B5ZckCYQVyccIHnAY4RhfWEs-7whd4IAg&oe=6B0C76EF"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n3P-qDDJbSUQ7kNvwGwbu-L&_nc_oc=AdqmVE7VJJwQMVgv_M2xQW8A70eyLLz3qi277BthsF5H2XXcUvaqCxbQO_YRUucXyiQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRovwFSpj25UR4CGJ3pFYCbzKrhRiUF6q26o10xEx0FQg&oe=6B0C509A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fiQhcyKpYkYQ7kNvwEKriHt&_nc_oc=Ado3ApalGa26QTFMot2IZj8uSRQMwcNvU9SmflnUy2hbbnfUYyz0YtbH0oB9iNCdK80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTOarGqFUILplwWxjxF9aVK4GTPZe6Llz8SkEorkMVdmg&oe=6B0C6DFC"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon